# Response headers for Cloudflare Pages (expo export copies this into dist/).
# Nothing here affects Google login (full-page redirect), Supabase calls (CORS)
# or photo uploads (Edge Function, CORS).
#
# Stage 5 (offline on web) may need cross-origin isolation for SQLite. iPhone
# Safari only supports the strict form, so it would be:
#   Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
#   Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
# Progress photos are already shown as same-origin blob: URLs so they keep
# working with it; avatars and other cross-origin images would need checking.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(self), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=()

# File names contain a content hash, so they can be cached forever.
/_expo/static/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
